# "If a creature an opponent controls would die, exile it instead." On turn 3 Bot1's Lightning Bolt kills Bot2's Elvish Mystic,
# which is exiled instead of going to the graveyard. On turn 4 Bot2's Lightning Bolt kills Bot1's own Ornithopter, which
# is Garruk's controller's creature and goes to the graveyard as usual (the control).

